##Working in http://127.0.0.1:8000/docs

Day one: We create the venv for make the api work with
all the requeriments libraries.

endpoint then we need: 

Autentification:
POST /auth/register 
POST /auth/login 

products:
GET /products 
GET /products/{id} 
POST /products 

cart:
GET /cart 
POST /cart/add 
DELETE /cart/remove/{item_id}

Órders and payments:
POST /orders/checkout 
POST /orders/webhook-stripe 